# {version}

Additional documentation can be found at: https://periareon.github.io/rules_helm/

```python
bazel_dep(name = "rules_helm", version = "{version}")
```

## Extensions

Companion modules for charts that bundle container images. Each carries the
dependency on its image ruleset and re-exports the `rules_helm` API. See
https://periareon.github.io/rules_helm/images.html

### rules_img

```python
bazel_dep(name = "rules_helm_img", version = "{version}")
```

### rules_oci

```python
bazel_dep(name = "rules_helm_oci", version = "{version}")
```
